message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Improving Ukrainian Word Sense Disambiguation with Sense-Aware Sentence Embeddings"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Muryn"
    given-names: "Victor"
  - family-names: "Laba"
    given-names: "Yurii"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-07"

repository-code: "https://github.com/YuriiLaba/use"

abstract: >
  Research code accompanying the manuscript "Improving Ukrainian Word
  Sense Disambiguation with Sense-Aware Sentence Embeddings". The repository
  contains code for corpus collection, definition-based pseudo-labeling,
  data augmentation, contrastive fine-tuning, and evaluation on Ukrainian
  word sense disambiguation and general sentence-embedding tasks.

keywords:
  - natural language processing
  - word sense disambiguation
  - machine learning
  - sentence embeddings
  - low-resource languages